<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 12.</p>
<p>				    May 12/May 09   May 12/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.15		 6.05</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.09		 4.46</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.33		 8.39</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.44		51.02</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.43		31.15</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.42		32.13</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.79		 7.73</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.53		17.20</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.58		37.25</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.51		36.53</p>
<p>  International funds		   1.16		13.97</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.03		73.25</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,219,720,501,721</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,884,797,946,724</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,032,774,517,129</p>
<p>  International funds			    89,597,181,203</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    212,550,856,666</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
